[KO5 · Ritva (via Shittah Mekubbetzet): later despair cannot cure it]: C · Because the finder did not acquire at pickup and holds for the owner, the owner’s later despair does not confer acquisition. #explanation #opening #ritva {"id": "KO5", "sourceRef": ["Ritva (via Shittah Mekubbetzet) on Bava Metzia 21b, s.v. ורבא אמר הוי יאוש כיון דלכי ידע לא סגי דלא מייאש"], "sourceUrl": ["https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/בבא_מציעא_כא_ב#שיטה_מקובצת"], "speaker": "Ritva (via Shittah Mekubbetzet)", "provenanceClass": "C", "hebrewAnchor": "אף על גב דאייאש לבסוף לא מהני", "hebrewAnchors": [{"sourceId": "ri-possession", "sourceSha256": "45f5b8ba413468d13abc601d1395df290b7773be37974ded6ee50c6451b6905e", "startCodePoint": 102, "endCodePoint": 131, "quote": "אף על גב דאייאש לבסוף לא מהני", "purpose": "Later despair does not help"}, {"sourceId": "ri-possession", "sourceSha256": "45f5b8ba413468d13abc601d1395df290b7773be37974ded6ee50c6451b6905e", "startCodePoint": 200, "endCodePoint": 274, "quote": "וכיון שבשעת נטילה לא זכה הרי ידו כיד הבעלים וכנפקד שלהם שאין יאוש מועיל בו", "purpose": "Explanation in terms of holding for the owner"}], "anchorRelationship": "attributed-paraphrase", "anchorOffsetUnit": "Unicode code points; zero-based [startCodePoint,endCodePoint); no normalization", "temporalScope": "awareness, despair and possession relative to pickup; scope stated in attributed claim", "baseNodeIds": ["O2", "O5"], "sourceIds": ["ri-possession"], "anchorScope": "Hebrew spans are verbatim from the saved edition; the English claim remains an attributed paraphrase, not a literal quotation.", "reconstructionStatus": "statement", "color": "#53659c"}
