[KO6 · Ritva (via Shittah Mekubbetzet): not necessarily theft]: C · Ba-issura here describes taking while the object remains in the owner’s domain; it need not mean an intention to steal. #explanation #opening #ritva {"id": "KO6", "sourceRef": ["Ritva (via Shittah Mekubbetzet) on Bava Metzia 21b, s.v. ורבא אמר הוי יאוש כיון דלכי ידע לא סגי דלא מייאש"], "sourceUrl": ["https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/בבא_מציעא_כא_ב#שיטה_מקובצת"], "speaker": "Ritva (via Shittah Mekubbetzet)", "provenanceClass": "C", "hebrewAnchor": "ולאו באיסורא ממש שהרי לא נתכוון לגזול", "hebrewAnchors": [{"sourceId": "ri-possession", "sourceSha256": "45f5b8ba413468d13abc601d1395df290b7773be37974ded6ee50c6451b6905e", "startCodePoint": 321, "endCodePoint": 358, "quote": "ולאו באיסורא ממש שהרי לא נתכוון לגזול", "purpose": "Not necessarily an intention to steal"}, {"sourceId": "ri-possession", "sourceSha256": "45f5b8ba413468d13abc601d1395df290b7773be37974ded6ee50c6451b6905e", "startCodePoint": 392, "endCodePoint": 469, "quote": "אלא בשעת איסורא קאמרינן כלומר דכי אתא לידיה ברשות בעלים קיימא וכנוטל מידם דמי", "purpose": "Status: object remains in the owner’s domain at pickup"}], "anchorRelationship": "attributed-paraphrase", "anchorOffsetUnit": "Unicode code points; zero-based [startCodePoint,endCodePoint); no normalization", "temporalScope": "awareness, despair and possession relative to pickup; scope stated in attributed claim", "baseNodeIds": ["O2"], "sourceIds": ["ri-possession"], "anchorScope": "Hebrew spans are verbatim from the saved edition; the English claim remains an attributed paraphrase, not a literal quotation.", "reconstructionStatus": "statement", "color": "#53659c"}
